    website: https://github.com/poli0981
repository-code: https://github.com/poli0981/template-browser-extension
url: https://github.com/poli0981/template-browser-extension
abstract: >-
  Production-grade GitHub template for cross-browser Manifest V3 browser
  extensions targeting Chromium browsers (Chrome, Edge, Brave). Built on
  TypeScript 5.7 and Vite 8 with Node.js 24 LTS, including full CI/CD,
  CodeQL v4 scanning, Dependabot, release-please automation, and
  bilingual (EN/VI) documentation.
keywords:
  - browser-extension
  - chrome-extension
  - manifest-v3
  - mv3
  - typescript
  - vite
  - github-template
